<div class="page-title">🛡️ <span class="page-title-text">Admin</span></div>
<p class="page-subtitle">Manage SME owner accounts and datasets, and browse the end-user evaluation data they log at <code>/evaluation</code>. Template Evaluator and Business Owner Evaluator accounts, datasets, and evaluation results are each kept on their own separate pages and counted separately below.</p>

<div class="kpi-row">
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">SME owner accounts</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= smeCount %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Admin accounts</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= adminCount %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Datasets uploaded (SME)</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= datasetCount %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Evaluations completed (SME)</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= completed %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Evaluations in progress (SME)</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= inProgress %></div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Not started yet (SME)</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= notStarted %></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="kpi-row" style="margin-top: 14px;">
  <div class="stat-tile">
    <div class="stat-label">Template Evaluator accounts</div>
    <div class="stat-value"><%= expertCount %></div>
  </div>
